Hashti's token foundations include values originally derived from the official
@carbon/themes, @carbon/layout, @carbon/type, and @carbon/motion packages.
Hashti changes the CSS namespace, serializes the values as CSS/JSON, and adds
contextual layer aliases and typography/control conveniences. The original
attribution above is retained for those derived values.

